# Local test rig built by tools/setup-local.sh: vendored CDN libraries plus
# index.local.html, which is index.html with its five <script src> URLs
# repointed at those local files.
#
# This must never be committed. The patched copy only runs on a machine with
# .local-test/vendor/ sitting next to it, so committing it (or copying it over
# index.html) would ship a game that loads nothing for every real player.
.local-test/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
